Zenith 0011: menu switch colours. <menuSwitch> accepts <colorOn> and <colorOff>: the switch image is tinted per
state (and keeps its colours when the row is selected), so a theme can draw a coloured on/off switch.

diff -ruN a/es-core/src/ThemeData.cpp b/es-core/src/ThemeData.cpp
--- a/es-core/src/ThemeData.cpp	2026-10-10 15:33:30.685997871 +0200
